"Listens to your Mac's audio output while Media is open and playing. It's analyzed on this Mac as it plays and never recorded. macOS asks for permission the first time." = "当“媒体”标签页打开且正在播放时，监听 Mac 的音频输出。音频仅在本机实时分析，不会录制。首次使用时，macOS 会请求相应权限。";
"Five minutes before a meeting with a Zoom, Google Meet, Teams, Webex, Whereby, Jitsi, or FaceTime link, the closed notch counts down to it. Join from the Calendar tab." = "在带有 Zoom、Google Meet、Teams、Webex、Whereby、Jitsi 或 FaceTime 链接的会议开始前五分钟，收起的灵动岛会显示倒计时。可从“日历”标签页加入会议。";
"Pick a folder in iCloud Drive to reach your notes from the Files app or a Markdown app on iPhone. Notes on this Mac move to the new folder." = "选择 iCloud Drive 中的文件夹，即可通过 iPhone 上的“文件”或 Markdown 应用访问笔记。此 Mac 上的笔记会移动到新文件夹。";
"Looks at the clipboard twice a second while it's on. Skips passwords, anything marked private, and copies from password managers. Kept on this Mac only." = "开启后，每秒检查剪贴板两次。自动跳过密码、标记为私密的内容，以及来自密码管理器的复制内容。所有记录仅保存在此 Mac 上。";
"Beside the closed notch. While Downloading shows it once a download or upload runs at 1 MB/s or more for a few seconds, says how much it moved when it's done, and hides again; it checks every 3 seconds. Always reads the speed every second. Never shows speed beside the closed notch, and reads the speed only while the tab is open." = "显示在收起的灵动岛旁边。“下载时”模式会在下载或上传速度达到 1 MB/s 并持续数秒后显示；传输结束时显示传输总量，随后自动隐藏，每 3 秒检查一次。“始终”模式每秒读取网速。“从不”模式不在收起的灵动岛旁显示网速，仅在网络标签页打开时读取。";
"Add the tools you use; the ones in color are signed in on this Mac. Each reads only its own sign-in and sends it only to its own service." = "添加你使用的工具；彩色图标表示已在此 Mac 上登录。每个工具只读取自身的登录信息，并且仅将其发送到对应服务。";
"Spend estimates use public price lists from LiteLLM, models.dev, and OpenUsage. Usage code adapted from OpenUsage; provider logos from theSVG." = "费用估算采用 LiteLLM、models.dev 和 OpenUsage 的公开价格表。用量计算代码改编自 OpenUsage；服务提供商图标来自 theSVG。";
"Phones on the same Wi-Fi can send you files with Quick Share, set to Everyone. Nothing is saved until you accept in the notch." = "连接同一 Wi-Fi 的手机可通过设为“所有人可见”的 Quick Share 向你发送文件。只有在灵动岛中接受后，文件才会保存。";
